{
  "id": "fabric-zipper",
  "name": "Fabric Zipper",
  "url": "shaders/fabric-zipper.wgsl",
  "description": "Unzip a woven fabric cover to reveal the underlying image. The zipper slider follows the mouse and the opening spreads above it. The cloth is a lit 2/1 twill whose diagonal rib scale is set by Weave Frequency and slides with each flap as it parts, and the opening's edges roll back into tape lips (roll highlight, dark underside) that cast a soft contact shadow onto the revealed image.",
